<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T US corn/soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T US corn/soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Friday for a combined shipment of 20,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The tender specifies that bids should be based on May futures prices, traders said.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			 U.S. Gulf Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn    20,000    April 16-30  May 1-15</p>
<p> Soybean 10,000    April 16-30  May 1-15</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
